      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait sorry, what do you mean by a goblin stealing from my desk? i was just asking about legal compliance for my shop. anyway, can you clarify what you meant by \"implementing appropriate security measures\"? what specifically should a small shop like mine be doing to prevent unauthorized access to the email list?",
